    <!-- fast code -->
    <string name="fast_explained">On their own, the engines run on an emulated iPhone processor. Fast code is that same engine translated into this phone\'s own code, from your own firmware: it sounds identical and starts speaking several times sooner. Classic Voices builds it here after each firmware import: it downloads the free Zig compiler from ziglang.org (about 53 MB) and deletes it when it\'s done, and it takes a few minutes per firmware. Fast code is made from Apple\'s code, so it stays on this phone.</string>
