    <string name="setting_fallback">Compact voice for pitch changes</string>
    <string name="setting_fallback_explained">Enhanced and premium voices can\'t change pitch. As VoiceOver did on iOS 5 and 6, anything spoken at a changed pitch uses the voice\'s compact version. Voices without a compact version here are unaffected.</string>
